{title: 658 - Heavenly Father, Hear Our Prayer}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #658 • NAME OF JESUS • 7.6.7.6.8.8.7.7}
{lyricist: Barbara E. Adam}
{composer: Ralph A. Strom}
{key: Db}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 658}
{meta: tune NAME OF JESUS}
{meta: meter 7.6.7.6.8.8.7.7}
{meta: category Christian Home - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Db]Heav'nly [Fm]Father, [Ebm]hear [Ab]our prayer
[Fm]As we [Db]bow [Gb]before [Fm]You:
[Gb]Bless them in [Bbm]the life [Ab]they share,
[Db]Humble [Gb]we [Fm]implore You.
[Ebm/Gb]Be their [Gdim]guide in [Db/Ab]all endeavors,
[Ab7]Be their [Db]hope [Bbm]that nothing [Ebm]severs;
[Ab]Constant source [Db]of love divine,
[Gb]Let Your [Gm]love [C7]within [Fm]them [Ebm]shine!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Db]As [Bbm]they [Fm]pledge [Ebm/Gb]their love [Ab]this day
[Fm]Here before [Gb]Your altar,
[Gb]May their hearts,, [Bbm]upon [Ab]You stayed,
[Db]Never [Gb]fail [Fm]or falter.
[Ebm/Gb]Be their [Gdim]comfort [Db/Ab]in all [Fm/Ab]sorrow;
[Ab7]Be their [Db]reason [Bbm]for [Ebm]tomorrow.
[Ab]Grant them strength [Db]to live each hour
[Gb]Trusting [Gm]solely [Fm]in Your [Ebm]pow'r.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Db]Blest [Bbm]Creator, [Ebm]Lord [Ab]of life,
[Fm]Hear our [Db]glad [Gb]thanksgiving.
[Gb]Husband You [Bbm]have joined [Ab]to wife
[Db]For their [Gb]earthly [Fm]living.
[Ebm/Gb]Justified [Gdim]by Jesus' [Db/Ab]merit,
[Ab7]Life eternal [Bbm]they [Ebm]inherit.
[Ab]When their days [Db]on earth have passed,
[Gb]Take them [Gm]to [C7]Your [Fm]home at [Ebm]last!
{end_of_verse}
